# time.pitch engine (ADR-0143 sections 2 and 6): engine/pitch renders the
# `pitch` verb of sample.edit as engine/control's sample_edit renders the
# others (the model, the session's take state, the WAV reader and writer, the
# session folder's names), and engine/control dispatches the verb to it.
# engine/pitch never includes engine/control, so the graph keeps no cycle.
# Folded into tools/module-deps.allow, with pitch.allow, once it is free.
engine/control -> engine/pitch
engine/pitch -> common/audiofile
engine/pitch -> common/model
engine/pitch -> common/session_files
engine/pitch -> engine/core
